¶ - L08 separates validated completion, authorized commit and final delivery.

loop:
  id: L08
  name: completion_and_delivery
  owner: delivery

¶ 1 — Completion Decisions

suggested_loop:
  work_finished: run_applicable_validation
  validation_failed: return_to_correction_without_completion_claim
  validated: record_required_operational_outcomes_under_existing_contracts
  inspect: actual_owned_new_modified_or_removed_code_including_untracked_files
  code_unchanged: deliver_without_empty_or_duplicate_commit
  code_changed: review_diff_and_isolate_owned_scope
  commit_authorized: invoke_existing_commit_skill_before_final_delivery
  commit_blocked: preserve_work_and_explicitly_report_uncommitted_changes_and_reason
  committed: include_commit_identifier_in_delivery
rule: prior_authorization_for_work_and_commit_needs_no_repeated_confirmation
rule: higher_priority_confirmation_or_prohibition_remains_binding
rule: existing_or_third_party_changes_are_never_staged_by_inference
rule: do_not_infer_code_changes_from_tool_use_or_dirty_tree_alone
rule: validation_task_completion_feature_closure_commit_and_delivery_are_distinct_events
rule: a_commit_is_neither_validation_nor_functional_completion
rule: no_git_commit_from_PostToolUse
rule: authority_for_commit_does_not_grant_push_merge_or_release

¶ 2 — Existing Functions

functions:
  review: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/skills/review/SKILL.md
  commit: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/skills/commit/SKILL.md
  context: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/scripts/commit_context.py
  interrupted_delivery: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/scripts/handoff_snapshot.py
rule: no_second_git_routine_or_completion_journal
